# Cursor Governance Law (repo)

## Two law files (do not confuse)

| File | Owner | Edit in |
|---|---|---|
| `@.cursor/governance/CANONICAL_LAW.md` | Global (symlink → Cursor-Governance) | **Never from IB-Odoo_19** |
| `@skills/PLASTICOS_CANONICAL_LAW.md` | PlasticOS repo | **This repo only** |

Read **`skills/PLASTICOS_CANONICAL_LAW.md`** for PlasticOS project skills (`skills/`),
version-bump law, and non-addon boundaries. Read the global symlink only for L9 /
GlobalCommands / path-contract concerns.

## Global (SSOT — single repo entry: `.cursor-commands`)

| Asset | Path |
|-------|------|
| GlobalCommands | `@.cursor-commands/` |
| Commands | `@.cursor-commands/commands/` |
| L9 skills | `@.cursor-commands/skills/l9-*/` |
| Global rules | `@.cursor-commands/rules/` |
| Wiring scripts | `.cursor-commands/ops/scripts/` |

## Repo `.cursor/` allowed

- `governance/CANONICAL_LAW.md` — symlink to governance law file only (do not edit target here)
- `rules/` — PlasticOS overlay
- `README.md`

PlasticOS law (tracked): `skills/PLASTICOS_CANONICAL_LAW.md` — not under gitignored `.cursor/governance/`.

## PlasticOS project skills (repo SSOT)

| Asset | Path |
|---|---|
| Skill packs | `skills/plasticos-*/` |
| Manifest | `skills/PLASTICOS_SKILLS_MANIFEST.yaml` |
| Discovery symlinks | `.claude/skills/plasticos-*` → `../../skills/...` (adapters only) |

Not an Odoo addon tree (like `scripts/` / `tools/`). Validate: `make check-plasticos-skills`.

## Forbidden

- `.cursor/governance` symlink to Dropbox root (exposes duplicate GlobalCommands tree)
- `.cursor/governance/GlobalCommands/`
- `.cursor/commands/`, `.cursor/skills/`
- PlasticOS skill SSOT under `.claude/skills/` or Cursor-Governance
- `__manifest__.py` / `__init__.py` under `skills/`

## Path contract (global CANONICAL_LAW §9)

- SSOT paths: **`$HOME/Dropbox/...` only** — never `/Users/<user>/...` or `/home/<user>/...`
- Bash resolver: `resolve_governance_paths.sh` → `$GOV_ROOT`, `$GLOBAL_COMMANDS`
- Global rule: `@.cursor-commands/rules/97-governance-ssot-paths.mdc` (`alwaysApply: true`)
- Hooks via `~/.cursor/hooks/` symlinks: use `realpath` + `$GLOBAL_COMMANDS`, not `dirname "$0"`

## Validate

```bash
bash .cursor-commands/ops/scripts/validate_governance_symlinks.sh
bash .cursor-commands/ops/scripts/validate_governance_no_hardcoded_paths.sh
make check-plasticos-skills
```
